{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2023-01-09 08:02:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE LAUNCHES NEW REWARDS PERK "FREEPOTLE" AND GIVES FANS THE CHANCE TO WIN FREE CHIPOTLE FOR A YEAR AT ALL RESTAURANTS IN THE U.S. AND CANADA', 'text': '"FREEPOTLE" PROVIDES CHIPOTLE REWARDS MEMBERS UP TO TEN FREE FOOD DROPS THROUGHOUT 2023 FANS CAN JOIN "FREEPOTLE" BY SIGNING UP FOR CHIPOTLE REWARDS BEFORE MARCH 6 EXISTING CHIPOTLE REWARDS MEMBERS ARE AUTOMATICALLY ENROLLED IN "FREEPOTLE" TO CELEBRATE THE NEW PERK, CHIPOTLE WILL AWARD 3,100 CHIPOTLE REWARDS MEMBERS, IN RECOGNITION OF THE COMPANY\'S 3,100+ LOCATIONS, WITH "FREE CHIPOTLE FOR A YEAR"\xa0 CHIPOTLE REWARDS MEMBERS WILL BE ENTERED TO WIN WITH ANY IN-RESTAURANT OR DIGITAL PURCHASE ($5 MINIMUM) AT CHIPOTLE\'S RESTAURANTS IN THE U.S. AND CANADA THROUGH JANUARY 15* NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF. , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS LAUNCHING "FREEPOTLE," A NEW CHIPOTLE REWARDS PERK THAT GIVES MEMBERS UP TO TEN FREE FOOD DROPS THROUGHOUT 2023.'}